\section{Parameters}{

\code{Kmax} (\code{integer(1)}, required) caps model complexity: the maximum number of
changepoints (\code{label_type = "changepoint"}) or peaks (\code{label_type = "peak"})
the per-sequence segment path is searched over. The learner uses it to score
the label errors at train time. Each prediction records it per sequence in
its \code{extra} data (\code{as.data.table(prediction)$Kmax}), so the label-error
measure decodes the predicted penalty under the same cap.
}

